Bare-dot ordered markers

```
. first
. second
. third
.
<ol>
  <li>first</li>
  <li>second</li>
  <li>third</li>
</ol>
```

```
1. a
. b
. c
.
<ol>
  <li>a</li>
  <li>b</li>
  <li>c</li>
</ol>
```

```
.

.x is prose

.. text
.
<p>.</p>
<p>.x is prose</p>
<p>.. text</p>
```

```
.{#first .lead} one
. two

.{k=v}text
.
<ol>
  <li id="first" class="lead">one</li>
  <li>two</li>
</ol>
<p>.{k=v}text</p>
```
